---
title: "iMessage messaging features"
sidebarTitle: "Messaging features"
description: "Explore each iMessage messaging feature in its own guide."
---

Use these provider-specific features after choosing the cloud or local package
on the [iMessage provider](/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage) page. Unless noted,
these features require the cloud `@spectrum-ts/imessage` package.

<CardGroup cols={2}>
  <Card title="Message effects" icon="sparkles" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/message-effects">
    Send bubble and screen effects with text, markdown, or attachments.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Chat renaming" icon="pen-line" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/chat-renaming">
    Change the display name of a group chat.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Group avatars" icon="image" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/group-avatars">
    Set, clear, and retrieve group chat icons.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Group membership" icon="users" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/group-membership">
    Add, remove, list, and leave group chat members.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Inbound group events" icon="messages-square" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/inbound-group-events">
    Handle membership and group metadata changes from other participants.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Inbound read receipts" icon="check-check" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/inbound-read-receipts">
    Observe when recipients read messages sent by your agent.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Chat backgrounds" icon="panels-top-left" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/chat-backgrounds">
    Set or clear a conversation background image.
  </Card>
  <Card title="iMessage Apps" icon="layout-grid" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/apps">
    Send and update customized iMessage App cards.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Native contact card sharing" icon="contact" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/contact-card-sharing">
    Share the bot account's own contact card in a chat.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Native message metadata" icon="database" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/message-metadata">
    Read curated Apple delivery, formatting, attachment, and reaction fields.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Fetching attachments" icon="paperclip" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/fetching-attachments">
    Retrieve cloud attachments directly by iMessage GUID.
  </Card>
  <Card title="Tapback reactions" icon="heart" href="/spectrum-ts/providers/imessage/messaging-features/tapback-reactions">
    Map Spectrum emoji aliases to native iMessage tapbacks.
  </Card>
</CardGroup>
